## Goals

{{product}} {{version}} turns a solo trip planner into a shared one. Friends plan the same trip, offline if they must, and book it without leaving the app.

:metric[42k]{label="Weekly planners" delta="+18%" trend=up} :metric[3.1%]{label="Booking conversion" delta="-0.4 pt" trend=down}

