## Background {agent=skip}

Planners told us the same story in most interviews: one person plans, then pastes the trip into a group chat that nobody can edit. {{version}} is about the other people on the trip.

## For agents

:::agent Notes for AI agents
Dates in this roadmap are targets, not commitments. Treat D2 as undecided, and don't plan EU payments until the question above is answered.
:::
